{"scene_id": "s01460", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01460.fountain", "heading": "EXT. HARBOR REGATTA COURSE - DAY", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "WESLEY KOVALENKO", "names": ["WESLEY KOVALENKO", "WESLEY"], "gender": "m", "first": 4, "spoke": 12}, {"id": 1, "name": "AMINATA DRUMMOND", "names": ["AMINATA DRUMMOND", "AMINATA"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 8}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "EXT. HARBOR REGATTA COURSE - DAY", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Grey chop under a grey sky.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "White sails tilt in the distance like paper cutouts.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "A committee boat bobs near the starting line, a red flag snapping on its stern.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "On the committee boat's deck stands WESLEY KOVALENKO (50s, windbreaker, binoculars, a clipboard sheathed in plastic), a radio in his fist.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "A hundred yards off, in a battered single-handed dinghy, AMINATA DRUMMOND (20s, wetsuit, spray-stung face) trims a mainsheet.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Her knuckles are raw.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Aminata, you're early to the line.", "name": "WESLEY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["radio"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know.", "name": "AMINATA", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": ["radio, crackling"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Fall off. Tack. You've got ninety seconds.", "name": "WESLEY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["radio"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm fine.", "name": "AMINATA", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": ["radio"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "She isn't.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "The boat heels.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "She leans out, boots hooked under the strap, and hauls the sail in.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "The dinghy skims, a hull slapping the crest of each wave.", "para": 2, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Wesley lifts the binoculars.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Clenches his jaw.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Forty seconds. Come about.", "name": "WESLEY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["radio"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "She throws the tiller.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "The boom swings across, clips her shoulder, and sends her stumbling into the cockpit while the sail luffs.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Wesley mutters to himself, dropping the binoculars to his chest, climbing up onto the rail with one hand on the rigging.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Come on, come on.", "name": "WESLEY", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm up. I'm up.", "name": "AMINATA", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": ["radio"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "She scrambles upright, regains the tiller, swings the boat in a tight arc, and the sail fills with a crack like a rifle shot.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "A horn blasts across the harbor.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "The fleet surges.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And you're off. Four seconds late.", "name": "WESLEY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["radio"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is that a penalty?", "name": "AMINATA", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": ["radio"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a lesson.", "name": "WESLEY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["radio"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "She laughs, a harsh gasp, and leans out.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "The dinghy gains speed, cutting through the pack.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Wesley watches her go, lowers the radio, and for a moment lets his face show everything.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Then he lifts it again.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mark one in half a mile. Keep it low.", "name": "WESLEY", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["radio"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Copy.", "name": "AMINATA", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": ["radio"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "The first mark swings into view, a yellow buoy riding the swell.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Half the fleet crowds toward it.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "She lines up wide, takes the outside lane, and Wesley mutters again.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Don't do it.", "name": "WESLEY", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "She does it.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "She cuts inside at the last second, clipping the buoy's rope with her stern.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Boats scatter.", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "A whistle shrieks.", "para": 10, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Wesley sits down on the rail, head in his hands.", "para": 10, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Aminata.", "name": "WESLEY", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["radio, flat"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know. I touched the mark.", "name": "AMINATA", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": ["radio"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Do your turns.", "name": "WESLEY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["radio"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm doing them.", "name": "AMINATA", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": ["radio"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "The dinghy spins two full circles on the grey water, clean as a compass drawing.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "The pack, now far ahead, shrinks toward the horizon.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You'll finish last.", "name": "WESLEY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["radio"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'll finish.", "name": "AMINATA", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": ["radio"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "He smiles, finally.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Not at the radio, at the sea.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's the whole sport.", "name": "WESLEY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["radio"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}]}